# Authentication Scopes, Compatibility & Versioning Policy

> Topic: Per-endpoint authentication/authorization scopes and anti-IDOR rules (`CT5`), additive vs. breaking change classification (`CT7`), the `D-NN` breaking change protocol, and the One-Version Rule (`CT8`) for {{project_name}}.

